From: Oliver Solomon <47696354+OliverSolomon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:41:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Host controls: ribbon tabs, Viewing mode, turned-off
 commands, web fonts, AI button

- Session::host_block refuses what a host page turned off (exact ids or
  prefix*) and, in Viewing mode, anything that changes the document; it
  greys controls through why_disabled and holds for interface commands.
- ui.mode switches Editing, Reviewing and Viewing from the ribbon.
- The host may hide ribbon tabs, File included.
- Fonts the host can fetch are listed as served in the font box; a pick
  or a rest asks the host for them, and fonts_changed relays them out.
- An AI button beside Comments queues an ai event (ui.ai).
